{"3940470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KILLSEC", "steam_appid": 3940470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILLSEC</strong> is a fast-paced, close-quarters combat simulator which demands you respond quickly to an ever-changing landscape of enemies, robots, and environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the speed scale to your advantage. The faster you move, the faster time moves - but staying still certainly won't get you very far.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master mouse-controlled physics weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.poster.avif?t=1787667829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.webm?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.mp4?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time moves faster as you move, push your reactions to the limit</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/67dda38763ebdadd4b74361abfbca121.poster.avif?t=1787667829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/67dda38763ebdadd4b74361abfbca121.webm?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/67dda38763ebdadd4b74361abfbca121.mp4?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Released weapons keep their momentum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/96bdc43a64dc80cff3d4f7b2dca64091.poster.avif?t=1787667829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/96bdc43a64dc80cff3d4f7b2dca64091.webm?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/96bdc43a64dc80cff3d4f7b2dca64091.mp4?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILLSEC</strong> is a fast-paced, close-quarters combat simulator which demands you respond quickly to an ever-changing landscape of enemies, robots, and environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the speed scale to your advantage. The faster you move, the faster time moves - but staying still certainly won't get you very far.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master mouse-controlled physics weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.poster.avif?t=1787667829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.webm?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940470/extras/480d849930cd28aae4deb37b3c604a45.mp4?t=1787667829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time moves faster a